# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). Closest to the title: a crystal tune in single
# notes with silence between, a low crystal ostinato rocking on the half step, an organ holding the
# chords.
title    Volcanic
composer Claude
about    Black rock and rivers of lava, close to the title song: a crystal tune in D Phrygian that is only single notes with silence between, a low crystal ostinato rocking on the half step, an organ holding the chords, glass harmonica chords and a low fretless bass; the glass bird's calls are half steps. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, deep toms and a timbale; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    66
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead organ ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart toms timbale pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -timbale horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.78 pan=-0.1
voice organ    organ      vol=0.16 pan=0.2  center=D3 att=0.5 rel=1
voice ost      crystal    vol=0.36 pan=-0.3
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice toms     tomlo      vol=0.5  pan=-0.2
voice timbale  timbale    vol=0.3  pan=0.3
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice drive    pizz       vol=0.6  pan=-0.3 gate=0.5 rev=0.2
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

